            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5473] Enable z.show for R</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5473</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It should be consistent to enable z.show for both python and R languages.&#160; A notebook may contain both python and R paragraphs, it would show significant difference if one can support it but not the other.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Moreover, the zeppelin doc mentions the display system is backend independent, but it doesn&apos;t work for R.&lt;/p&gt;

